                                                "sense_id": "01789aec-7b4c-3dd1-99be-f83b6ad1c961",
                                                "text": "And Crates said, that love was cured with hunger, if not by time; and in him that liked not these two meanes, by the halter [translating hart]."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "878d52f0-cb38-44d5-b1d3-ed8e862c93a8",
